{"t":"TPL","made":"2026-11-27 02:42","name":"Texas Pacific Land Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","employees":114,"hq":"Dallas, TX, United States","website":"https://www.texaspacific.com","summary_en":"Texas Pacific Land Corporation engages in the land and resource management, and water services and operations businesses. The Land and Resource Management segment manages surface acres of land, and oil and gas royalty interest in Permian Basin. This segment also engages in easements, such as transporting oil, gas and related hydrocarbons, power line and utility, and subsurface wellbore easements. In addition, this segment leases its land for processing, storage, and compression facilities and roads; and is involved in sale of materials, such as caliche, sand, and other material, as well as sells land. The Water Services and Operations segment provides full-service water offerings, including water sourcing, produced-water treatment, infrastructure development, and disposal solutions to operators in the Permian Basin. This segment also holds produced water royalties. The company owns a 1/128th nonparticipating perpetual oil and gas royalty interest (NPRI) under approximately 85,000 acres of land; a 1/16th NPRI under approximately 371,000 acres of land; and approximately 33,000 additional net royalty acres, total of approximately 224,000 NRA located in the Permian Basin. The company was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Texas Pacific Land Corporation은 토지 및 자원 관리, 수자원 서비스 및 운영 사업에 종사하고 있습니다. 토지 및 자원 관리 부문은 퍼미안 분지의 토지 면적과 석유 및 가스 로열티 지분을 관리합니다. 이 부문은 또한 석유, 가스 및 관련 탄화수소 운송, 전력선 및 유틸리티, 지하 유정 지역권과 같은 지역권에도 관여합니다. 또한 이 부문은 처리, 저장, 압축 시설 및 도로를 위해 토지를 임대합니다. 칼리체, 모래, 기타 자재 등 자재 판매와 토지 판매에 관여하고 있습니다. 물 서비스 및 운영 부문은 퍼미안 분지의 운영자에게 물 공급, 생산수 처리, 인프라 개발 및 폐기 솔루션을 포함한 풀 서비스 물 제공을 제공합니다. 이 부문에는 생산된 물 로열티도 보유됩니다. 이 회사는 약 85,000에이커의 토지에 대해 1/128의 비참여 영구 석유 및 가스 로열티 지분(NPRI)을 소유하고 있습니다. 약 371,000에이커 규모의 1/16 NPRI; 그리고 약 33,000 추가 순 로열티 에이커, 총 약 224,000 NRA가 페름기 분지에 위치합니다. 이 회사는 1888년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 댈러스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":261.37,"mcap":18027911168.0,"pe":30.713278,"fpe":3.574535,"peg":null,"ps":18.626839,"pb":10.003827,"ev_ebitda":21.863,"div":0.92,"beta":0.58,"hi52":547.2,"lo52":245.26},"fin":{"rev":967846016.0,"rev_g":0.346,"eps_g":0.376,"gross":0.94089997,"op":0.75738,"net":0.60707,"roe":0.37068,"fcf":81014624.0,"cash":369558016.0,"debt":17688000.0,"de":0.982,"eps":8.51,"feps":73.12},"own":{"short":0.0754,"inst":0.74666,"insider":0.00402},"analyst":{"n":2,"mean":319.0,"median":319.0,"high":388.0,"low":250.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.0,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":0,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":0,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":0,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":0,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-02-23","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":639.0,"priorPriceTarget":350.0},{"GradeDate":"2025-12-02","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":1050.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2024-08-12","Firm":"BWS Financial","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":917.0,"priorPriceTarget":917.0},{"GradeDate":"2024-05-10","Firm":"BWS Financial","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":917.0,"priorPriceTarget":917.0},{"GradeDate":"2024-04-02","Firm":"BWS Financial","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":917.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2024-01-23","Firm":"Stifel","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade